{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Master, I want to take you outside.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Miya, the pet cat, tells me to go outside and look up at the sky,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I see a starry sky and... countless &quot;dried sardines&quot; falling from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the dried sardines to make Miya happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABOUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Cloudy Days, Dried Dried Sardines&quot; is a casual catch game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All you need to do is click the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the dried sardines falling from the sky by clicking them to aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also use the coins you collect in the game to spin the &quot;Dress Up Gacha.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cute outfits for Miya, who loves fashion.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573980?t=1744347882","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573980?t=1744347882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573980/8c528fe77479efe39f937ba0db24e00f0372c598/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744347882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573980/8c528fe77479efe39f937ba0db24e00f0372c598/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744347882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Master, I want to take you outside.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Miya, the pet cat, tells me to go outside and look up at the sky,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I see a starry sky and... countless &quot;dried sardines&quot; falling from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the dried sardines to make Miya happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABOUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Cloudy Days, Dried Dried Sardines&quot; is a casual catch game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All you need to do is click the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the dried sardines falling from the sky by clicking them to aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also use the coins you collect in the game to spin the &quot;Dress Up Gacha.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cute outfits for Miya, who loves fashion.</p>","developers":["\u4e7e\u6771"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573980/a96a59747570d528813749b877d8b2405a099add/header.jpg?t=1744347882","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109758,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109758/movie480.mp4?t=1741537572","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109758/movie_max.mp4?t=1741537572"},"name":"\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u6620\u50cf","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257109758/d50c3cec41c34198c35e485fe1ef8bc4cd6ad863/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741537572","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109758/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741537572","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109758/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741537572"}}],"name":"\u66c7\u308a\u306e\u3061\u306b\u307c\u3057 : Cloudy, then Dried Sardines","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"ma